        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Make the rice first. Season it while it is hot and keep it covered with a damp towel at room temperature &mdash; the fridge makes sushi rice hard. Mix both sauces and cook the shrimp next; they can wait in the fridge. Cut the cucumber and avocado, set out the nori, and slice the steelhead last, right before you sit down. Then put everything on the table and build as you go.</p>",
